  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      199.29,
      228.77,
      364.41,
      252.83
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA TEA BOARDLAW, NO. 14 OF 1975",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.93,
      401.9,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      401.87,
      329.03
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Tea Board(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      343.13,
      401.89,
      405.23
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 6 of the Sri Lanka Tea Board Law,No. 14 of 1975 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) and shall have effect as section 6A of thatenactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      419.33,
      401.88,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "6A. (1) The Minister may appoint to theBoard, a Working Director other than themembers referred to in section 6 from amongpersons who have had wide experience in thearea of tea industry.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      233.85,
      495.53,
      363.58,
      506.87
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Working Director shall\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      249.57,
      520.85,
      354.59,
      532.19
    ],
    "text": "(a)be a full time officer;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      249.57,
      546.29,
      401.88,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)assist the Chairman in thepromotion of the development ofthe tea industry within andoutside Sri Lanka; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      250.29,
      609.77,
      401.87,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(c)assist the Chairman in theadministration, management andoperation of the affairs of theBoard including the co-ordinationof the activities of the Board.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      307.51,
      443.86,
      316.58
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      345.19,
      448.29,
      392.66
    ],
    "text": "Insertion ofnew section6A in LawNo. 14 of1975.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
