    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      347.35,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "2Sri Lanka Tea Board (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      202.73,
      397.18,
      237.47
    ],
    "text": "(3) The Minister may remove the WorkingDirector from office after assigning reasonstherefor.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      249.53,
      397.18,
      331.07
    ],
    "text": "(4) The term of office of the Working Directorshall be for a period of three years from the dateof appointment and he shall be eligible forreappointment unless he has been removed fromoffice as referred to in subsection (3). Suchreappointment shall be for not more than onefurther term, whether consequent or not.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      343.13,
      397.18,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "(5) The office of the Working Director shallbecome vacant upon death, removal from officeunder subsection (3) or resignation by letter inthat behalf addressed to the Minister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      401.69,
      397.19,
      459.83
    ],
    "text": "(6) Where the Working Director by reasonof ill health, infirmity or absence from Sri Lankais temporarily unable to perform the duties ofhis office, the Minister shall appoint anothermember of the Board to act in his place.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      471.89,
      397.2,
      518.27
    ],
    "text": "(7) The Working Director shall be paid suchremuneration as may be specified in the relevantPublic Enterprise Circular issued by theMinistry of Finance.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      530.21,
      397.2,
      553.43
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
